          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>\nAnd it affects their order and makes it difficult for them\n</li>\n<li>\nto adhere to their tenets of faith and demobilizes\n</li>\n<li>\ntheir congregations. They seek from the utmost generosity\n</li>\n<li>\nthat they be engulfed with the same generosity that has engulfed the distant\n</li>\n<li>\nand the close, and Muslim and dhimm\u012b, and dissipation\n</li>\n<li>\nof the root of their grievance by issuing a noble decree towards\n</li></ol>\n",
